Wassup family🫡 Idk I just felt like somebody needed to hear something real ya feel me…that failure is not the end of it all ya know. This month makes a year that I’ve been on this app and from the time I’ve been here I’ve been all about the middle class traders/investors. Hell, I’m a mailman that likes to trade 🤷🏽‍♂️ it’s nothing rich about me I just put in a ton of hours in to understand trading mechanics and I try to help where I can. 

This market has been crazy this year…prob one of the craziest years I’ve seen in a while. Whether you’re a new trader or seasoned, the market is doing exactly what is purpose right now and it to get you out of position and have you fearful to put money in. I’ve been watching traders step away left and right because the market is punching them in face and reality is setting in to the point ppl are financially exhausted. Bruh everyone don’t have millions to invest with, so now you gotta look at bills, kids, gas, day to day life and tell yourself “I can’t afford to put anymore money in this market”…..that’s reality for most of us. If you need to hear this then ADJUST, just don’t quit. Now isn’t the time to shut down and walk away from the market. If anything take the money and the free time to go on Amazon and invest in your knowledge and find some books, watch some YouTube, backtest strategies while you’re on the sidelines….Knowledge is the key to freedom, just dig a lil deeper. 

Right now everything and I mean everything is crippled by chaos. Like I said this month makes a year I’ve been on this app and  things are just changing good & bad. I don’t know dude personally but I’m watching ppl go hard on NPO lately for his plays, bruh 6-8 months ago alot y’all would’ve followed him to depths hell when he alerted and now ppl crucifying him because trades aren’t the same??? I’m not taking up for anybody but that shit ain’t cool not for him or anybody else for that matter. If he is just of rhythm y’all are fckin up cuz a lot of the shit I’ve been seeing is not helping. Shit is toxic af especially if somebody is attempting to make ppl money. 

There is alot of value on this app and I’ve brought and met a lot good ppl on this platform and I’m finna do what I always do and point out places you can look to for help because this shit is bigger than just RoyaltyTradez. So you should start hittin the follow button if you’ve read this far. 

@based is the homie and he’s posts the Strat for tickers every morning and he’s been doing it since I first started. We normally posts around the same time every day so if you see my Pre Market Analysis then be on the look out for his daily posts too. 

I don’t really know @FullPortOrBust  honestly but I followed him thru @NewFishBigPond  who knows the BTC and MSTR side of the market damn near inside and out. But  FullPort makes the charts his bitch using volume profiles and gives solid levels all day. Big salute to the King and all you gotta do is open his posts. 

@aaplbottomjeans  has been giving much exposure to Quant Data along with the strategies that comes along with it. If charts aren’t your thing then maybe learning the data side of it is, but again you don’t know if you’re not being exposed to it 🤷🏽‍♂️. He was my 2nd discord home back in the day. Nothing but a whole lot str8 ❤️ for ya Brodie 😂

@Sambo_Trades  makes reading levels simple using the break and retest strategy and it adds another useful style of trading to your arsenal if the one you’re using it’s giving you the results you want. We’ve made a lot of ppl money together last year and now he’s leading the Cashflow Cartel 🫡

@TradeWithCash  and @papastonks , these two are my original fam and I started my discord journey with them yrs ago. Cash builds his own indicators and shares them with his community and Papa takes as much time needed with traders to help them learn how to be profitable traders. Much love to Premium Options 🐂

@FridgeFinancials  gives so much valuable info on the economic and valuation side of trading. If you’re interested in understanding the market outside of charts you should be reaching out to him if you haven’t on top of his YouTube videos. 

If you’re absolutely new to the market I’ve watched two traders absolutely grow learning the basics to now leading the way. I remember when @trynamakeit  was picking the minds of every trader he liked and he now has quite the following almost a year later. Lil bro went from asking the questions to now answering them…and with him knowing how it feels being on the learning side to now being on the teaching side is a valuable trait because he stays humble and loves to educate. The other is @Dacubemastr …I don’t even think he’s a full year into TA but he’s up and coming, trust me. He’s been calling weekly levels lately and he’s gonna be in this next wave of ppl to rise to the top very quickly. Kingdom Vibes 👑

Apparently I somewhat have a voice on here so I’m using it to give resources in these market conditions…it’s on you guys to trust this posts, along with the ppl I’ve tagged and not to give up on yourself. I treat trading like a sport because I’ve always had a competitive nature and that always kept me on my toes in whatever I took part in. Brain training is a real thing just like muscle memory and when you’re continuously doing the same thing everyday, while tweaking your methods to improve then eventually you start to sync with whatever it is you’re doing. Nobody in this game is 100% right but the success takes place on how fast and clear are you able to recognize transitions from one direction to another. The quicker you recognize the signs the easier the money is to make…no one way is the right way trade because if that was the case everyone would use it. So continue to expand your knowledge, follow these ppl and learn their ways because good players knows who the other good ones are🫡. I knew this post was gone be long af but if you read this it was meant to be a blessing to the ones that needed it🙏🏾

